// [user 2026-08-08] BAKED build-mode placements. Source: coop_mod/save/build_m2l2b.dat
// (below its SESSION START marker). Blueprints route through collectible.scr, which spawns
// a private copy per player so one can vanish for its finder alone. Angles are the full
// (pitch yaw roll) triple - several placements are pitched flat against a surface.
